# GMOD-Trainbuild-Public-G-Scale-Stuff
Hello! This is my first GitHub repository and I made it solely to have people who don't have any stuff for GMOD G-Scale to be able to have something. It will take a while, so be patient please. I often like to go between doing certain things and there's a good chance I may stop for a while. :P

---------------------------------------------------------
How to set it up:
1. Spawn loco(s) and seat car.
2. Connect Pod Controller to 1st seat on the seat car.
3. Wire the stand e2's rlcpt entity to pt1's entity of the same name.
4. Wire Start to the seat cars key and MU Master (specifically the lead loco if using the duo) to the switch next to the key.
5. Wire bell to the RLC cstand chip's bell output and wire the speedo to the rlc chips mph output.
6. Wire the light at the front/back of the locomotive and connect them to their corresponding blue buttons.

And that's about it if I'm not forgetting anything.
